 simplifying business, streamlining our operations, improving margins, and driving greater innovation through the better use of technology.Let me highlight some of the specific accomplishments that the new leadership team…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/21/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2017-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2017 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2018-03-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"In terms of costs actions, we launched what we call EIP -- Excess in Process -- Wave II which is expected to drive $75 million to $100 million in annual cost savings by the end of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/21/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2017-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2017 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2018-03-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Charhon","x":"Given our fourth-quarter results, we are reaffirming the guidance for the full year of 2018 we provided during our Investor Day earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/21/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2017-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2018 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2019-02-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"However, in weak economic times, we are more cautious, in stronger economic times, by definition, we have more pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2018 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2019-02-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"And I do think we have a very strong track record and business model that drives -- that gives us a pricing power and we are going to take advantage of all of those levers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2018 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2019-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"Specifically, during 2018, we made large investments in technology and operating model restructuring to make Laureate a more scalable enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2018 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2019-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Charhon","x":"Finally, please note that $20 million of our cash flow performance was related to the favorable timing of early collection in Australia and the deferral of severance payments to 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q1","e":"laur","d":"2019-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"Although we were pleased with our favorable new enrollment trends in Brazil, the macro economic conditions remain challenging resulting in weak pricing power in a very competitive market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/laureate-education-inc-laur-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q1","e":"laur","d":"2019-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"So a fatigued consumer with excess capacity is causing unfavorable pricing power in that market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/laureate-education-inc-laur-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q1","e":"laur","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Shlomo Rosenbaum","x":"The cost takeout, maybe some of the stranded costs that you're still working down from some of the divestitures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/laureate-education-inc-laur-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q1","e":"laur","d":"2019-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"JJ Charhon","x":"We are maintaining our full-year guidance before we adjust for the impact of the sale of UniNorte in Brazil.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/laureate-education-inc-laur-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q2","e":"laur","d":"2019-08-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"We are -- we continue to invest behind competency-based education and also invest in other tools such as AI and VR to help further differentiate the product portfolio and the overall experience at Walden.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/laureate-education-inc-laur-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q2","e":"laur","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"JJ Charhon","x":"Before I comment on free cash flow, let me update you on the $35 million cost reduction in G&A we committed to execute throughout 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/laureate-education-inc-laur-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q2","e":"laur","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Leonard","x":"Just curious on the decision to reaffirm guidance versus kind of move some things upwards given that it sounds like revenue and EBITDA coming in a little bit ahead of expectations and you're doing pretty well on the cost savings side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/laureate-education-inc-laur-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"JJ Charhon","x":"This has put even more emphasis on the importance of cost reduction initiatives, which have performed well ahead of expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/laureate-education-inc-laur-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2019-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"JJ Charhon","x":"For free cash flow, we are reiterating guidance of approximately $145 million, despite almost $40 million of negative impact associated with the timing of our divestitures and adverse effects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/laureate-education-inc-laur-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2019-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Howe","x":"Looking to your 2020 guidance, you have raised guidance for adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/laureate-education-inc-laur-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2019 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"JJ Charhon","x":"Consequently, our EBITDA margin were up almost 300 basis points in the fourth quarter and reflect the acceleration of our cost reduction initiatives across all segments and at corporate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/laureate-education-inc-laur-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LAUR 2021 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"The strong operating performance during the third quarter saw financial results come in ahead of our expectations, which in turn led us to raise our guidance for the full year 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/laureate-education-inc-laur-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LAUR 2021 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard M. Buskirk","x":"As a result, we are increasing our full year guidance for 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/laureate-education-inc-laur-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"LAUR 2024 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2024-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Buskirk","x":"This growth was driven by a 9% increase in average total enrollments and 1% of price/mix effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/laureate-laur-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2024 Q3","e":"laur","d":"2024-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"The improved operating performance is expected to be largely offset by currency headwinds from a weaker Mexican peso, allowing us to essentially maintain our full year outlook on an as-reported US dollar basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/laureate-laur-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2025 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2026-02-19","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"Additionally, we are expanding our addressable market through continued AI-enabled investments in digital education with a significant focus on fully online segment for working adults.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/laureate-laur-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2025 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2026-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"And it was driven by some uncertainties following the election, the uncertainty around tariffs and the trade situation between Mexico and the United States.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/laureate-laur-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2025 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2026-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Buskirk","x":"For full year 2025, revenue growth of 9% was driven by a 6% increase in average total enrollments and 3% of price/mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/laureate-laur-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2025 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2026-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Buskirk","x":"We are seeing a price/mix impact on average revenue per student due to the higher growth rate of our fully online programs, which are offered at a lower price point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/laureate-laur-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2025 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2026-02-19","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Silber","x":"The market is very jittery these days about AI disruption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/laureate-laur-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2025 Q4","e":"laur","d":"2026-02-19","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Silber","x":"Do you see any parts of your business that might be at risk from AI disruption?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/laureate-laur-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2026 Q1","e":"laur","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"With the intakes now finalized, we have good visibility into the remainder of the year, and we are reaffirming our full year guidance for enrollments, revenue and adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/laureate-laur-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2026 Q1","e":"laur","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"We are increasing our guidance for adjusted earnings per share to reflect the $105 million in share buybacks completed during the first quarter, and we anticipate further share buybacks through the remainder of 2026 as return of excess capital remains a priority for the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/laureate-laur-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2026 Q2","e":"laur","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Eilif Serck-Hanssen","x":"Future bilateral discussion will focus on improving market access, strengthening regional production and addressing select tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/laureate-education-laur-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LAUR 2026 Q2","e":"laur","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Buskirk","x":"Pricing during the primary intake was largely in line with inflation for our traditional face-to-face programs, 